  "evidence": "TEXT_D: Raise personal allowance to £10,000; credible deficit reduction plan with identified savings; job-creation measures and green stimulus; protect frontline NHS and integrate health and social care; £2.5bn Pupil Premium and class size reductions; apprenticeships and skills; political reform after expenses scandal. TEXT_G: Leave the EU as core vision; five‑year freeze on permanent immigration; major law‑and‑order crackdowns and prison expansion; 40% defence spending increase; climate‑sceptic energy stance; voucherisation/privatisation moves in NHS and education.",
